cw_first	one
cw_created	one
no_time_before	one
creator_before	one
beginning_creation	one
beginning_time	one
time_not_yet	one
# "before" differs across claims: created wisdom is "before all things" in order of creation, while the Creator's Eternity is "before it" non-temporally. Each claim keeps one sense across its own statements, so no claim is in two senses.
# "wisdom" (uncreated vs created) is explicitly distinguished in S1–S3. Every statement that uses cw_created refers to the created wisdom only.
